        "description": "Goodrich Road East, access from Dohles Rocks Road",
        "advice": "Use alternative route",
        "information": "\u2022\tAccess to Goodrich Road East from Dohles Rocks Road will be permanently closed to all traffic and the road shortened following the start of main construction. This will allow for the construction of the southbound exit ramp.\n\u2022\tAlternative access to Goodrich Road East will be available via Silvereye Drive intersection with Dohles Rocks Road.\n\u2022\tTraffic control measures, including traffic control, reduced speed limits and construction signage will be in place throughout the works. Motorists are advised to adhere to the directions of traffic control at all times.\n\u2022\tThe signalling system at the Dohles Rocks Road, Goodrich Road East intersection will be modified to support the closure of access to Goodrich Road East. \n",
